NAME: snippet demo: the core-clear snippet, started at its entry
DESCRIPTION: includes snippets/clear.src and compiles to the clear archetype's code (labels renamed); see behtests/snippet_clear.beh
SRC:
(program
  (include "snippets/clear.src")
  (start top)
  (clear top 4))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b
ORG top

_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #4     
top   
_REP8 
  MOV.I  $_X1_bomb, >_LET1 
  JMP    $_REP8 , #0     
_X1_bomb
  DAT    #0     , #0     
  DAT    $0     , $0     